WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.436 --> 00:00:03.346
限定本轮消息路径 / Scope this run’s message paths

2
00:00:03.346 --> 00:00:06.244
开启 Recording / Start Recording

3
00:00:06.244 --> 00:00:09.241
发送六条公开消息 / Send six public messages

4
00:00:09.241 --> 00:00:12.450
选择本轮连接 / Select this run’s connection

5
00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:15.446
打开消息页 / Open the messages tab

6
00:00:15.446 --> 00:00:18.393
选择 Response 消息 / Select response messages

7
00:00:18.393 --> 00:00:21.541
展开 guide-short / Expand guide-short

8
00:00:21.541 --> 00:00:24.544
选择 Raw 查看原文 / Select Raw to inspect the text

9
00:00:24.544 --> 00:00:27.512
复制当前短消息正文 / Copy the current short message body

10
00:00:27.512 --> 00:00:30.484
收起短消息 / Collapse the short message

11
00:00:30.484 --> 00:00:33.692
展开 guide-long / Expand guide-long

12
00:00:33.692 --> 00:00:37.093
拖动正文右下角缩小高度 / Drag the body corner to reduce its height

13
00:00:37.093 --> 00:00:40.143
在长消息中滚动 / Scroll inside the long message

14
00:00:40.143 --> 00:00:43.139
用键盘到达消息末尾 / Reach the message end with the keyboard

15
00:00:43.139 --> 00:00:46.092
到底后继续滚动消息列表 / Continue scrolling the list at the body boundary

16
00:00:46.092 --> 00:00:49.053
复制完整长消息正文 / Copy the complete long message body

17
00:00:49.053 --> 00:00:52.041
使用消息专用 Copy / Use the message-specific Copy

18
00:00:52.041 --> 00:00:55.136
全屏查看这条消息 / View this message fullscreen

19
00:00:55.136 --> 00:00:58.298
Escape 返回同一消息 / Return to the same message with Escape

20
00:00:58.298 --> 00:01:01.191
在新连接发送205条消息 / Send 205 messages on a new connection

21
00:01:01.191 --> 00:01:04.193
选择新的 pages 连接 / Select the new pages connection

22
00:01:04.193 --> 00:01:07.193
打开新连接的消息 / Open messages for the new connection

23
00:01:07.193 --> 00:01:10.643
滚动加载后续消息页 / Scroll to load subsequent message pages

24
00:01:10.643 --> 00:01:13.694
展开第205条消息 / Expand message 205

25
00:01:13.694 --> 00:01:16.744
切到 Raw 查看末条原文 / Switch to Raw for the last message text

26
00:01:16.744 --> 00:01:19.793
继续滚动使末条正文完整可见 / Continue scrolling to show the whole last message

27
00:01:19.793 --> 00:01:22.792
复制最后一条并核对 index 204 / Copy the last message and verify index 204

28
00:01:22.792 --> 00:01:25.745
返回 Settings / Return to Settings

29
00:01:25.745 --> 00:01:28.642
打开 Certificates / Open Certificates

30
00:01:28.642 --> 00:01:31.746
关闭本轮解密 / Disable this run’s decryption

31
00:01:31.746 --> 00:01:34.928
移除自有localhost例外 / Remove the owned localhost exception
